"ts":"1627725996.025500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7p07i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0956e528-d488-4900-be24-03bf2b0f41c3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"面積的にギリギリなのは人が介入すると配線不能になる。稀にその逆もあるけどもw","ts":"1627725936.024000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rCl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3601bc24-561c-4822-8525-b63ce4c2bd49","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ポリウレタンとかは動作確認したあとエポキシ樹脂とかで埋めちゃいますね","ts":"1627725887.022700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qqe63"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48e7f292-fdda-4dee-95da-333d07999e49","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ああそういう意味だと、重要なところだけ手でつないで残りを自動配線が正義","ts":"1627725839.021200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1627725851.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"edz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70c7996a-b84d-49e6-83dc-f13b92787ebd","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ああいやPCBの配線を手で描くってことです","ts":"1627725811.020500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bD6l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ec438c0-e909-4b09-a243-02079391fbb1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ICチップ繋ぐんだったら、(実質)空中配線の方がunstableでしょ…","ts":"1627725782.019900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CFGE5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1278c63c-3627-4b31-9931-9dc185b73235","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"アナログ信号触るなら手でやるしかない","ts":"1627725755.019300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=j2iO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73ea7799-cdd8-4755-ad34-a7fe3f105bf4","type":"messa